# S11 — router public IPv6 LAN addresses for the nginx $knots_via_lan map.
# Rewritten by /etc/hotplug.d/iface/90-knots-lan-addrs on lan ifup/ifupdate.
# Private / ULA / link-local addresses are matched in knots-ui.conf directly,
# so an empty file never locks a LAN client out over IPv4.
